X=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the image of $X$ under the action of $T$ by calculating the matrix product $TX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}TX & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}5 & -9 \\\\ 7 & -3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the respective endpoints of the image are ${A}^{′}(5,7)$ and ${B}^{′}(-9,-3),$ as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13990291/assets/177ca7f40ef24cf2f45a15b78487700d1f0efd094c975079cf4704b46debefb1.png)" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13990291/state.json" "file_sha256" "189f499fd99732bc8822a37ca68683a0b9726dc38f8e1d007e1a266a07e5db54"} {"question" "q-77717" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13990291/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "05374865d4d6a8be836ddaec0b406b0587de6ded509e6ed871d1bca1b6c8fa4f"} {"question" "q-77717" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13990291/state.json" "file_sha256" "189f499fd99732bc8822a37ca68683a0b9726dc38f8e1d007e1a266a07e5db54"} {"question" "q-77717" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["image" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13990291/assets/15134cfea5a58d0351be842c28d087a50591d60fb6a9f8ee36bcf4b35fb950ed.png"] ["image" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13990291/assets/177ca7f40ef24cf2f45a15b78487700d1f0efd094c975079cf4704b46debefb1.png"] ["image" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/referenc